 </span><span class=\"fn\">d </span><span class=\"fn\">t </span><span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hd</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.Win\">Win</a> <span class=\"fn\">arr</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ht</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.Win\">Win</a> <span class=\"fn\">arr</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">t</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">he</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">e</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray.w\">LimbArray.w</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Writes `t 2ᵉ % F` into the window at `d`, for a residue `t` in the window at `t`, disjoint from\nit, and `e = w q + b < w n` with `0 < b`, with the shift by `b` bits in the passes of the\nrotation: the low `n - q` limbs of `t` shifted into the window above its low `q` limbs, then the\nnext `q` limbs shifted and negated into the low `q` limbs, since `2^(w n) ≡ -1`, with the bits\nshifted out of the first part. What is left, the bits shifted out of the second part and the top\nlimb of `t` shifted, is subtracted from the limbs from `q` on by `subTopAt`.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.rotShlAt","kind":"def","line":1091,"name":"MPN.FFT.rotShlAt","source