e window at `d`, for a residue `t` in the window at `t`, disjoint\nfrom it, and `q = e / w < n`. The limbs of `t` above `n - q` wrap around negated, since\n`2^(w n) ≡ -1`: they are subtracted from zero into the low `q` limbs, the others are copied above\nthem less the borrow and the top limb of `t`, and `1` is added when that borrows.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.rotAt","kind":"def","line":768,"name":"MPN.FFT.rotAt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/FFT/Fermat.lean#L768-L797"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.addSubModAt_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">addSubModAt_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">arr</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class