Array.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span> → <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">L</span> → <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <span class=\"fn\">L</span>) → <span class=\"fn\">L</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`-(x 2ᵇ) - c` with a borrow, for `0 < b < w` and `c ≤ 2ᵇ`: the next `c` is the bits of `x` above,\nplus the borrow, so that it is at most `2ᵇ` again.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.negShlStep","kind":"def","line":310,"name":"MPN.FFT.negShlStep","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/FFT/Fermat.lean#L310-L317"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.shlStep\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">shlStep</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foun